        <mxCell id="TBD-3" value="TBD-EXP-03 | Potable-water quality basis and storage demand&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Owner: systems engineering with allocated domain lead. Closure: analysis and&lt;br&gt;stakeholder review establish measurable limits and verification scenarios&lt;br&gt;before&lt;br&gt;G1. Status: open; no value inferred from artwork." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=16;fontColor=#152b43;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#bac9d8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="740" height="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TBD-4" value="TBD-EXP-04 | Site loads, drainage, soil and refuge structural basis&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Owner: systems engineering with allocated domain lead. Closure: analysis and&lt;br&gt;stakeholder review establish measurable limits and verification scenarios&lt;br&gt;before&lt;br&gt;G1. Status: open; no value inferred from artwork." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=16;fontColor=#152b43;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#bac9d8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="520" width="740" height="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TBD-5" value="TBD-EXP-05 | Mobile mass, travel limits and equipment retention&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Owner: systems engineering with allocated domain lead. Closure: analysis and&lt;br&gt;stakeholder review establish measurable limits and verification scenarios&lt;br&gt;before&lt;br&gt;G1. Status: open; no value inferred from artwork." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=16;fontColor=#152b43;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#bac9d8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="900" width="740" height="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TBD-6" value="TBD-EXP-06 | Essential load reserve and module interchange time&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Owner: systems engineering with allocated domain lead. Closure: analysis and&lt;br&gt;stakeholder review establish measurable limits and verification scenarios&lt;br&gt;before&lt;br&gt;G1. Status: open; no value inferred from artwork." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=16;fontColor=#152b43;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#bac9d8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="900" width="740" height="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
